sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Simulator
    participant I as Redis + ingestion<br/>+ feature service
    participant P as Prefect
    participant A as Decision agent
    participant T as MCP tools<br/>(scorer, resolver, data)
    participant V as Plan validator

    S-)I: AIS messages and compliance events (all day, continuously)
    P->>A: start day d (budget K)
    A->>T: get_shortlist()
    T-->>A: ranked hulls, scores<br/>and eligibility today
    loop for each unclear hull
        A->>T: resolve_identity / get_timeline / get_events
        T-->>A: same hull? (confidence) + history
    end
    A->>T: submit_inspection_plan(K hulls + reasons)
    T->>V: proposed plan
    alt plan valid and on time
        V-->>P: agent plan
    else invalid, over budget, timeout or LLM down
        V-->>P: scorer top-K (fallback)
    end
    P->>S: send final plan
    S-)I: inspection results (used from day d+1)
